BEGIN NEW DATA CASE
C IEEE 14, 1d1q + AVR + governor, fault at bus 14 at 1 s, LT13-14 open at 1.2 s
C Generated by make_atp.py from the data of power_flow.jl and rms.jl.
C Base: 100 MVA, 1 ohm = 1 pu, 1 V = 1 pu peak phase-to-ground.
C XOPT = COPT = 60: L field = X in ohm at 60 Hz, C field = B in umho.
C  dT  >< Tmax >< Xopt >< Copt >
   5.E-5     10.     60.     60.
   10000       2       0       0       1       0       0       1       0
MODELS
INPUT
